      "message": "Maybe something like this to reduce branching?\n`half(atan(-coord.y, -sign(coord.x - 0.00001) * max(abs(coord.x), 0.00001)))`\nThis will pass 0 for x in atan(y, x) when coord.x \u003d\u003d 0.00001, which presumably is less likely than coord.x being zero (we make a similar assumption in the linear gradient shader).",
